7/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:61%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfasmowonx/"></a>Дознаватель, ревизор, инспектор, криминалист</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfas7dvwoy/"></a>12</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfassvqk0p/"></a>12</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfasgzuvhd/"></a>12</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfastptgwl/"></a>12</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:2%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfaskw0ic6/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:61%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfasve7g4k/"></a>Главный специалист</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfasqqf3l4/"></a>11</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfasqfic3g/"></a>11</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfas0n514s/"></a>11</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/11151/dfas0kwz37/"></a>11</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBo